  "question": {
    "text": "If $\\log _{e}\\left(x^{2}-16\\right) \\leq \\log _{e}(4 x-11)$, then"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "$4     < x \\leq 5$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$x     < -4$ or $x>4$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$-1 \\leq x \\leq 5$",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "$x     < -1$ or $x>5$",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given, \\(\\log _{e}\\left(x^{2}-16\\right) \\leq \\log _{e}(4 x-11)\\) if and only if\r\n\\(\\begin{array}{l}\r\nx^{2}-16 \\leq 4 x-11 \\\\\r\n\\Rightarrow x^{2}-4 x-5 \\leq 0 \\\\\r\nx^{2}-5 x+x-5 \\leq 0 \\\\\r\n\\Rightarrow x(x-5)+1(x-5) \\leq 0 \\\\\r\n(x-5)(x+1) \\leq 0\r\n\\end{array}\\)\r\nSign scheme of \\(x^{2}-4 x-5 \\leq 0\\)\r\n<img src=\"assets\\st0025_d50ac3dffe52.png\">\r\n\\(-1 \\leq x \\leq 5\\)"
  }
}